config PAYLOAD_CDK2
	bool "CDK2"
	depends on ARCH_X86
	select HANDOFF_COREBOOT_TABLES
	select WANT_LINEAR_FRAMEBUFFER
	select SMMSTORE
	help
	  Build CDK2 from its source submodule and add its ELF image as the
	  primary payload. CDK2's 32-bit entry accepts coreboot's standard cdecl
	  payload handoff from either a 32-bit ramstage or the protected-mode
	  compatibility call made by a 64-bit ramstage. The current transition
	  also requires coreboot-produced SMMSTORE and linear framebuffer table
	  records.
